4784BKM9P","number":5,"title":"Atlas program","description":"Atlas program - ROLLING milestone. The initial Atlas efforts are tracked here; follow-on Atlas work keeps landing in this milestone indefinitely. It does not close when any single effort completes - it is the standing home for Atlas work (Drew, 2026-11-12: 'Atlas has initial efforts but there will be follow-on work indefinitely'). Code-repo home of the program; the hatch-personal 'Atlas program' milestone is its twin.","creator":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":24,"closed_issues":54,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:47Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:52:51Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-11-05T05:27:46Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:11:43Z","closed_at":"2026-11-17T03:11:40Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/8983","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: [#6019](https://github.com/developing-today/code/issues/6019) (semi-automated ingestion operations). Research source: prior-art doc `~/workspace/scratch/atlas-ingestion-brief-2026-11-04/prior-art-research.md` (2026-11-04). Follow-up 38 (Cluster 7). Builds on the staging tier #5669 (merge-on-close promotion exists today).\n\n## Finding (research, in substance)\n\nlakeFS's write-audit-publish pattern maps exactly onto Atlas's needs: ingest onto a staging branch/shard, validate, publish to the live set only if checks pass. The gate sequence per batch:\n\n1. **Write** to a staging shard (never directly to the searchable corpus).\n2. **Classify** — classification scan (family under #6021) assigns/verifies tier before anything lands.\n3. **Dedup** — exact + near-duplicate edges recorded (ingest-time dedup pipeline, #5733 family).\n4. **Provenance-check** — every chunk carries a parseable source mark (sibling grammar design under #6018) + attestation (sibling under #6019).\n5. **Publish** — promote to the live shard set; a failed batch never touches the searchable corpus, and retry is safe (content-addressed landing per #3125).\n\n## Done looks like\n\nA gate design: stage contracts, per-stage pass/fail semantics, failure/quarantine handling, publish atomicity against fan-out search (#5755).\n\n<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=muse state=filed source=main-chat-2026-11-04-wave2 -->","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6057/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6057/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}